## STEP 4 — โครงสร้าง Next.js

อ่าน `references/04-nextjs-starter.md` เพื่อ Boilerplate code และ folder structure

**Standard Folder Structure (ทุกโปรเจกต์):**
```
src/
├── app/
│   ├── layout.tsx          (fonts + metadata)
│   ├── globals.css         (design tokens)
│   ├── page.tsx            (homepage)
│   ├── api/
│   │   ├── contact/        (POST: save + email)
│   │   ├── booking/        (POST: appointment)
│   │   └── [feature]/      (unique feature API)
│   └── (admin)/admin/      (dashboard)
├── components/
│   ├── layout/             (Nav, Footer)
│   ├── sections/           (Hero, About, Services...)
│   ├── ui/                 (Button, Card, Input...)
│   └── [feature]/          (feature-specific)
├── lib/
│   ├── supabase.ts         (client + server)
│   ├── r2.ts               (image upload)
│   └── [business-logic].ts
└── types/index.ts          (all TypeScript types)
```

